---
import ApertureIcon from './ApertureIcon.astro';
---
<section class="sec-block" id="faq">
	<div class="kicker sec-anim">
		<ApertureIcon />
		<span>Tanya Jawab</span>
	</div>
	
	<div class="mb-[36px] sec-anim">
		<h2 class="font-display text-[26px] font-bold tracking-tight mb-[8px]">Pertanyaan umum</h2>
		<p class="text-text-muted text-[15px] max-w-[560px] font-body">
			Belum ketemu jawabannya? Tanyakan langsung lewat WhatsApp.
		</p>
	</div>
	
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-[48px] gap-y-0 sec-anim">
		<!-- FAQ Items Kiri -->
		<div class="flex flex-col">
			<details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Apakah kamera dan lensa termasuk dalam sewa?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Tidak. Yang kami sediakan adalah ruang, lighting, dan kru on-set. Kamera, lensa, dan software editing dibawa sendiri oleh fotografer atau tim produksi Anda.
				</p>
			</details>
			
			<details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Apakah bisa reschedule jadwal yang sudah dibooking?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Bisa, selama pengajuan dilakukan minimal H-2 sebelum jadwal awal dan slot pengganti masih tersedia. Reschedule berlaku maksimal satu kali per booking.
				</p>
			</details>

			<details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Bagaimana kebijakan pembatalan?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Pembatalan H-3 sebelum jadwal mengembalikan DP penuh. Pembatalan di bawah H-3 DP hangus dan dapat dialihkan ke jadwal lain dalam 30 hari.
				</p>
			</details>
            
            <details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Berapa lama konfirmasi setelah DP dibayar?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Slot langsung terkunci begitu bukti transfer DP diterima tim kami, biasanya dikonfirmasi via WhatsApp dalam waktu kurang dari satu jam pada jam operasional.
				</p>
			</details>
		</div>

		<!-- FAQ Items Kanan -->
		<div class="flex flex-col">
			<details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Apakah boleh membawa vendor MUA atau stylist sendiri?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Boleh. Add-on MUA dan stylist di atas bersifat opsional — Anda bebas membawa tim kreatif sendiri tanpa biaya tambahan dari kami.
				</p>
			</details>
			
			<details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Apakah tersedia sesi survey lokasi sebelum booking?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Tersedia, khusus untuk produksi skala besar. Hubungi tim kami via WhatsApp untuk menjadwalkan kunjungan singkat di luar jam sewa berbayar.
				</p>
			</details>
			
			<details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Apakah tersedia parkir?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Tersedia area parkir untuk mobil dan motor di dalam kompleks studio, cukup untuk kru produksi hingga 15 orang.
				</p>
			</details>

            <details class="group border-b border-border py-[18px] transition-colors duration-350">
				<summary class="flex items-center gap-[10px] cursor-pointer font-semibold font-title text-[15px] list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
					<span class="w-[20px] h-[20px] rounded-full border-[1.3px] border-accent text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-350 group-open:bg-accent group-open:text-[#fff8ee] group-open:rotate-45">
						<ApertureIcon class="w-[10px] h-[10px] transition-transform duration-350" />
					</span>
					Apa yang terjadi jika sesi molor dari waktu yang dipesan?
				</summary>
				<p class="text-[14px] text-text-muted mt-[12px] leading-[1.7] font-body">
					Overtime dihitung per jam mengikuti tarif 1 jam yang berlaku dan langsung ditagihkan di akhir sesi, tanpa penalti tambahan lain.
				</p>
			</details>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>